<title>USA: Ralphs Grocery issues $155 mln in 11.00 pct debt.</title>
<headline>Ralphs Grocery issues $155 mln in 11.00 pct debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Ralphs Grocery Co was priced in the 144A private placement market late on Friday, according to a high-yield syndicate source.</p>
<p>The notes are an add-on to Ralphs' 11.00 percent 10-year issue priced on May 31, 1995.</p>
<p>BT Securities Corp was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER RALPHS GROCERY CO</p>
<p>AMT $155 MLN	 COUPON 11.00 PCT  MATURITY 6/15/2005</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 105.50  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/97 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 9.997 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS			   CALLABLE 6/15/2000</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
